300	\subsection{DVD Generation Variance Evaluation}
301	\label{sec:exp_dvd}
302	
303	We evaluate DVD on 12 open-weight models, generating 50 responses per item at temperatures 0.7--1.0 across 2,000 MMLU items.
304	
